OL,3,GNEWSAPatients to face higher hospital
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople visiting hospitals in Shrewsbury
OL,7,Fand Telford will have to pay more for
OL,8,Fparking from next month.
OL,10,FThe Shrewsbury and Telford Hospital
OL,11,FTrust said it was "currently operating
OL,12,Fin a challenging financial environment,
OL,13,Fwith rising costs requiring difficult
OL,14,Fdecisions to be made about how money is
OL,15,Fused".
OL,17,FIt promised to make improvements to
OL,18,Fparking and said the cost of the park
OL,19,Fand ride service to the Royal
OL,20,FShrewsbury Hospital would not increase
OL,21,Fagain this year.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
