OL,3,GNEWSAPatients to face higher hospital
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Neal, the trust's head of estates
OL,7,Fand facilities apologised for the
OL,8,Fincreases and said: "We have aimed to
OL,9,Fkeep increases as small as possible and
OL,10,Fprotect the free parking concessions."
